]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"结束（끝이 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"结束（끝이 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4b1f7ffd2ec7a8a79e1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91162-4-7-2","ko":"네, 좋은 생각이 많이 모였습니다.","zh":"是的，大家提出了很多好点子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이","audio":"/audio/4cbc2bb73481851c34fc.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"모였습니다.","meaning":"被征集，被聚集，被统一","explanation":"모이다：被征集，被聚集，被统一；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"4","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모였습니다","audio":"/audio/e674dbc5441c54641cf7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","z